  $q$```csharp
Ziak a = new Ziak();
a.Body = 4;
Ziak b = a;
bool v = a == b;

class Ziak
{
    public int Body;
}
```
Akú hodnotu bude mať premenná `v`?$q$,
  array[$q$`true`$q$, $q$`false`$q$, $q$`1`$q$, $q$`0`$q$], 0, $q$`b = a` neskopíruje objekt – obe premenné ukazujú na ten istý, preto `==` vráti `true`.$q$,
  $q$```csharp
Ziak a = new Ziak();
a.Body = 4;
Ziak b = a;
bool v = a == b;

class Ziak
{
    public int Body;
}
```
What value will the variable `v` have?$q$,
  array[$q$`true`$q$, $q$`false`$q$, $q$`1`$q$, $q$`0`$q$], $q$`b = a` doesn't copy the object – both point to the same one, so `==` returns `true`.$q$);

